---
import Overlay from "../../templates/Overlay.astro";
import Content from "../../templates/Content.astro";
import Grid from "../../templates/Grid.astro";
import Card from "../../templates/Card.astro";
---
<Overlay speaker="Lee Service" logo>
    <Content>
        <h2>Skills that travel between roles</h2>
        <Grid columns={3}>
            <Card color="var(--color-kainos-blue)">
                <h3>Understand people</h3>
                <p>Use playtesting to surface user experience insights.</p>
            </Card>
            <Card color="var(--color-kainos-green)">
                <h3>Connect teams</h3>
                <p>Work across client, business, and development teams.</p>
            </Card>
            <Card color="var(--color-kainos-orange)">
                <h3>Own the outcome</h3>
                <p>Support client satisfaction while keeping business needs in view.</p>
            </Card>
        </Grid>
        <p>These are transferable strengths described in Lee's LinkedIn profile—not a claim that the roles were the same.</p>
    </Content>
</Overlay>
